Analyze the following independently designed recursive function and predict what value it returns when called with n=4:

```python
def recursive_sum(n):
    if n == 1:
        return 1
    return n + recursive_sum(n - 1)

value = recursive_sum(4)
```

Trace the execution of this independently designed generator function step by step and predict the sequence of values produced when iterated:

